# lists1 — LPUSH, RPUSH and LRANGE
#
# Learn: a list is ordered. LPUSH adds to the head (left), RPUSH to the
# tail (right), and LRANGE key 0 -1 reads the whole list head to tail.
# LPUSH a b c pushes one at a time, so the list ends up c, b, a.
#
# Task: build the list pipeline:app so that LRANGE pipeline:app 0 -1
# returns build, test, deploy, in that order.
#

LPUSH pipeline:app build test deploy
LRANGE pipeline:app 0 -1
